                "zh-CN": "用户数据保留本地：SQLite、settings、window 状态和 secrets.json；日志不记录 JSON 内容或 API key。",
                "en": "User data stays local: SQLite, settings, window state, and secrets.json; logs do not record JSON content or API keys."
